sentences.text:
Having regard to the facts and circumstances of the case, it is hereby ordered that out of total compensation amount, the amount is disbursed as follows :
(a) Petitioner No.1/Avnesh Tiwari (father of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs. 20,84,465/- (Rupees Twenty Lacs Eighty Four Thousand Four Hundred Sixty Five Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
(b) Petitioner No.2/Hemata (mother of deceased) shall be entitled to share amount of Rs. 20,84,465/- (Rupees Twenty Lacs Eighty Four Thousand Four Hundred Sixty Five Only) alongwith proportionate interest;
Avinesh Tiwari & Ors Vs Vijay Pal & Ors Page no. 16 of 20 44.

